      "id": "sec-eo-7",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Bhabesh Mukherjee (to Sourav Datta)",
      "dialogue": "You think the paper was slow because people were lazy. The paper was slow because when a man has to write a number in ink with his own hand, he thinks twice about whether the cargo actually exists."
